4
00:01:01,738 --> 00:01:04,405
<i>Once upon a time,</i>

5
00:01:05,172 --> 00:01:08,805
<i>in a cozy little town with beautiful scenery,</i>

6
00:01:10,838 --> 00:01:15,372
<i>there lived a dependable father
named Jae Hong,</i>

7
00:01:17,838 --> 00:01:21,872
<i>a kind and gentle mother named Kyung Hee,</i>

8
00:01:22,772 --> 00:01:27,605
<i>and their dutiful daughter, Ye Ji,
who never gave her parents a moment's worry.</i>

9
00:01:48,338 --> 00:01:50,705
<i>As long as they had each other,</i>

10
00:01:50,705 --> 00:01:55,138
<i>the three needed no treasure in the world.</i>

11
00:01:55,138 --> 00:01:58,272
- Honey.
- Mommy.

12
00:01:58,272 --> 00:02:00,538
Let's get filthy rich.

13
00:02:01,972 --> 00:02:05,105
Yeah, honey. Let's make it big.

14
00:02:05,105 --> 00:02:07,272
[Emergency Medical Center]

15
00:02:09,305 --> 00:02:14,605
<i>And so, the couple decided
they were going to make it big.</i>

16
