But what should I do?
I might be a little late.

734
00:45:31,572 --> 00:45:33,972
I'll try to wrap up as early as I can.

735
00:45:33,972 --> 00:45:35,505
- Thanks, honey!
- Good luck with filming.

736
00:45:35,505 --> 00:45:37,305
Yeah, thanks.

737
00:45:38,172 --> 00:45:39,838
I'll call you later.

738
00:45:48,038 --> 00:45:50,972
Director, well...

739
00:45:50,972 --> 00:45:53,872
About Jae Hong...

740
00:45:57,405 --> 00:46:01,172
I mean, at the clinic, Ryu Ji...

741
00:46:03,372 --> 00:46:06,172
Never mind. Have a good day.

742
00:46:06,172 --> 00:46:07,805
Okay.

743
00:46:13,705 --> 00:46:15,172
This is what's trending these days.

744
00:46:15,172 --> 00:46:16,905
Funny, right?

745
00:46:16,905 --> 00:46:18,838
Here, watch it again.

746
00:46:18,838 --> 00:46:20,638
This is the point.

747
00:46:20,638 --> 00:46:21,638
It's funny, right?

748
00:46:21,638 --> 00:46:24,772
The more I think about it,
the funnier it gets.

749
00:46:40,672 --> 00:46:44,538
[GPS Tracks Live]

750
00:47:04,072 --> 00:47:08,005
Yeah, right. You said you were
having dinner with the PD.

751
00:47:43,372 --> 00:47:46,072
Lim Jae Hong, you punk.

752
00:47:55,805 --> 00:47:58,272
So this is your kind of place?

753
00:47:58,272 --> 00:48:01,138
I should've just left him
to rot in that moldy house.

754
00:48:01,138 --> 00:48:05,001
I was wrong. This is all my fault.

755
00:48:05,001 --> 00:48:07,881
[GPS Tracks Live]

756
00:48:54,438 --> 00:48:57,238
[Exclusive, Ryu Ji Su and Kang Tae Han
The affair in the drama becomes reality]

757
00:48:57,238 --> 00:48:59,372
